4.19-4.22 (m, 1 H, pyrrolidine-H), 4.65 (d, J = 13.0 Hz, 1 H, NCH), 5.46
(d, J = 13.0 Hz, 1 H, NCH), 7.27-7.33 (m, 2 H, binaphthyl-H), 7.42 (d, J
= 9.0 Hz, 1 H, binaphthyl-H), 7.47-7.54 (m, 4 H, binaphthyl-H), 7.61 (d,
