CH3×2), 1.23 (brs, 40H, myristic acid CH2×20), 1.48-1.49 (m, 4H, myristic
acid-β-CH2×2), 1.73-1.97 (m, 4H, Glu-βCH2×2), 2.24-2.32 (m, 8H, myristic
acid-α-CH2×2 + Glu-γCH2×2), 2.34-2.58 (m, 8H, succinic acidCH2×2
+NCH2CH2CONH×2), 3.40-3.60 (m, 8H, NCH2CH2O×2 + NCH2CH2CONH×2), 3.96-3.97
(m, 2H, Gly-CH2), 4.05-4.20 (m, 6H, NCH2CH2O×2+ Glu-α-CH×2), 7.84-7.86
(t, J=4.8Hz, 1H, CONH), 8.18-8.20 (d, J=7.6Hz, 1H, CONH), 8.30-8.32 (d,
J=7.6Hz, 1H, CONH), 12.41(brs, 4H, Glu-COOH×4). ESI MS(m/z): calcd. for
C54H93N5O17: 1083.66; found: 1106.7 ([M+Na]+).Anal. calcd. for
C54H93N5O17: C, 59.81; H, 8.64; N, 6.46; O, 25.08. found: C, 59.74; H,
8.52; N, 6.41; O, 24.98.
