Che, Ye; Gerstenberger, Brian S.; Huband, Michael; Knafels, John D.;
Lemmon, M. Megan; Li, Chao; McCurdy, Sandra P.; McElroy, Eric;
Rauckhorst, Mark R.; Tomaras, Andrew P.; Young, Jennifer A.; Zaniewski,
Richard P.; Shanmugasundaram, Veerabahu; Han, Seungil
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
