$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
2-((((Z)-1-(2-Aminothiazol-4-yl)-2-(((2S,3S)-1-((((S)-4-(5-hydroxy-4-oxo-1,4-dihydropyridine-2-carboxamido)-2-oxopyrrolidin-1-yl)sulfonyl)carbamoyl)-2-methyl-4-oxoazetidin-3-yl)-amino)-2-oxoethylidene)amino)oxy)-2-methylpropanoic
Acid (9). In a 25 mL flask were combined 4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinic
acid27 (100 mg, 0.30 mmol), 7 (220 mg, 0.30 mmol), HATU (133 mg, 0.35
mmol), DIPEA (55 μL, 0.4 mmol), and DMF (3 mL). The reaction was stirred
at room temperature for 16 h, after which time it was diluted with EtOAc.
The organics were washed three times with 50% brine and then
concentrated. The crude material was eluted through a plug of SiO2 with
10:1 DCM/MeOH. The pooled fractions were concentrated and dissolved in
MeOH (3 mL). Pd black (50 mg) was added, and the suspension was stirred
under 1 atm of H2 for 3 h until complete debenzylation was observed. The
reaction was then filtered, and the filtrate was concentrated and
redissolved in DCM (2 mL). The reaction was cooled to 0 °C, and TFA (1
mL) was added. The reaction was allowed to warm to room temperature and
stirred for 3 h. The reaction was concentrated, purified by C18
reversed-phase chromatography (0-100% MeCN/H2O with 0.1% formic acid),
and lyophilized.
2-(((Z)-(1-(2-Aminothiazol-4-yl)-2-(((2S,3S)-1-((((R)-4-(5-hydroxy-4-oxo-1,4-dihydropyridine-2-carboxamido)-2-oxopyrrolidin-1-yl)sulfonyl)carbamoyl)-2-methyl-4-oxoazetidin-3-yl)amino)-2-oxoethylidene)amino)oxy)-2-methylpropanoic
acid (19): This compound was made and purified analogously to 9 from
4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinic acid (7)(328 mg, 0.98 mmol) and tert-butyl
2-(((Z)-(2-(((2S,3S)-1-((((R)-4-amino-2-oxopyrrolidin-1-yl)sulfonyl)carbamoyl)-2-methyl-4-oxoazetidin-3-yl)amino)-1-(2-((tertbutoxycarbonyl)amino)thiazol-4-yl)-2-oxoethylidene)amino)oxy)-2-methylpropanoate
(700 mg, 0.98 mmol). The product (150 mg, 22%) as a white solid. UPLC RT
= 0.46 min, MS (ES) MH+: 698 for C24H27N9O12S2; 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO-d
6) δ ppm 1.21-1.44 (m, 9 H) 2.54-2.85 (m, 1 H) 3.56-3.93 (m, 2 H) 4.05
(dd, J=10.17, 6.78 Hz, 1 H) 4.45 (dd, J=8.10, 3.01 Hz, 2 H) 6.70 (s, 1 H)
7.56 (s, 2 H) 7.92 (s, 1 H) 9.00 (d, J=8.29 Hz, 1 H) 9.15 (br. s., 1 H).
HRMS (ES+) Calcd for C24H28N9O12S2 [MH]+ 698.1293; Found 698.1282.
